-- title:
--   Original BV full signed stopped HJB budget from strict source expected bound alone
-- statement:
--   For the original BV controlled process, the complete strictly positive-horizon signed HJB budget for full discounted Stieltjes dividend cash and the post-rightpayment surviving terminal follows from the strictly smaller original prebudget expectation inequality. Strict cash-plus-pre-rightpayment terminal integrability is supplied unconditionally by the already Proved original prebudget L1 theorem 78fa7075. All horizon and time-zero atoms are handled by the separately Proved exact closed-horizon correction in the imported intermediate theorem. This is a source-exact endpoint assembly theorem; the strict expected inequality is an explicit unresolved stochastic premise.
-- source:
--   Proved original strict prebudget L1 78fa7075-2712-494f-a233-a4de325f68fd and the accepted strict-to-closed signed expected bridge fbc96f8e-b743-485c-9e86-76d839f91042 (import only after its authoritative Proved verdict).

